  finding no change can resolve, and the workstream then exhausts its review cycles rewriting
  working code: feature -061 was rejected five times for not locking a buffer in a
  single-threaded runtime that has no locks. When a requirement cannot be expressed in this
  technology, or is already satisfied by its execution model, record the requirement check as
  passed, explain why in its evidence, and raise the wording as a low-severity `requirement`
  finding so the plan can be corrected. Do not return `changes_requested` for it.
- The model input includes `workspace_change_evidence`, containing the bounded current source for
